---
<section class="bg-[#111111] py-28 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-14">
      <span class="block text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#FFD100] mb-5">Every Sunday Edition</span>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white">What's inside every edition</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-[#FFD100]/10">
      <div class="bg-[#111111] p-10 hover:bg-[#1a1a1a] transition-colors group">
        <span class="text-4xl block mb-6">🔭</span>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">What I'm Watching</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/55 leading-relaxed font-light">The market stories and economic signals I'm actually tracking this week. Not the noise. Not the headlines everyone's shouting about. The things that could genuinely move your money.</p>
        <div class="h-px bg-[#FFD100] mt-6 scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform origin-left"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-[#111111] p-10 hover:bg-[#1a1a1a] transition-colors group">
        <span class="text-4xl block mb-6">📊</span>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">What I'm Doing</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/55 leading-relaxed font-light">My real positioning. What I'm buying, holding, or stepping away from and exactly why I'm making that call. This is what you can't find anywhere else. No vague advice. Just what's actually happening.</p>
        <div class="h-px bg-[#FFD100] mt-6 scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform origin-left"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-[#111111] p-10 hover:bg-[#1a1a1a] transition-colors group">
        <span class="text-4xl block mb-6">⚡</span>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Your Monday Move</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/55 leading-relaxed font-light">One specific, executable action you can take before the week starts. Concrete. Actionable. Yours to take or leave but it'll be there waiting for you every Sunday morning.</p>
        <div class="h-px bg-[#FFD100] mt-6 scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform origin-left"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-[#111111] p-10 hover:bg-[#1a1a1a] transition-colors group">
        <span class="text-4xl block mb-6">🛠</span>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">The Tools</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/55 leading-relaxed font-light">The apps and platforms I use and recommend, so you're never stuck with "I want to do this but I don't know where to start." From Nigerian equities to dollar-denominated assets you'll have the infrastructure.</p>
        <div class="h-px bg-[#FFD100] mt-6 scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform origin-left"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<hr class="border-none h-px bg-[#FFD100]/15" />
